WEBVTT

01:13.000 --> 01:18.300
[Meet Yourself]

01:20.000 --> 01:24.300
[Episode 31]

01:27.193 --> 01:27.673
Put it down.

01:27.674 --> 01:28.642
Out of the way.

01:28.643 --> 01:30.002
Get that bastard out.

01:30.003 --> 01:30.672
Come on.

01:30.673 --> 01:32.112
You have no idea
what I would do!

01:32.113 --> 01:32.393
Exactly!

01:32.393 --> 01:33.193
I'm warning you.

01:33.194 --> 01:35.383
We use this broom
to clean the bathroom!

01:35.803 --> 01:37.562
There's no use talking to her.

01:37.563 --> 01:38.312
Just go.

01:38.313 --> 01:39.413
Take her away.

01:42.003 --> 01:43.592
You said you're his girlfriend.

01:43.593 --> 01:45.592
Do you know that
he's cheating on you?

01:45.593 --> 01:47.082
He said he didn't do that.

01:47.083 --> 01:48.112
He doesn't know the girl!

01:48.113 --> 01:48.832
He didn't do that!

01:48.833 --> 01:49.922
He didn't do that?

01:49.923 --> 01:52.023
If that was true,
why would he run?

01:52.443 --> 01:54.442
That's ridiculous.

01:54.443 --> 01:55.443
Bah!

01:55.563 --> 01:56.233
Grab her!

01:56.233 --> 01:57.333
I'll take the broom.

02:04.283 --> 02:05.543
- Together.
- With me.

02:11.723 --> 02:12.592
Out of the way.

02:12.593 --> 02:13.003
Look what you've done.

02:13.004 --> 02:14.143
Keep your distance!

02:14.513 --> 02:15.513
They deserve that.

02:16.403 --> 02:17.002
Manjun!

02:17.003 --> 02:17.882
Xie Zhiyao!

02:17.883 --> 02:18.163
Finally.

02:18.163 --> 02:18.683
What's wrong?

02:18.683 --> 02:19.282
Are you hurt?

02:19.283 --> 02:21.792
They beat Youyu up,
claiming that he was seeing

02:21.793 --> 02:24.032
the fiancee of their friend.

02:24.033 --> 02:25.072
It can't be.

02:25.073 --> 02:25.912
Getting help?

02:25.913 --> 02:26.933
Call for help.

02:27.163 --> 02:28.442
You are her helpers?

02:28.443 --> 02:28.883
Stop.

02:28.883 --> 02:29.883
Hang on a moment.

02:30.003 --> 02:30.633
Let's make it clear.

02:30.634 --> 02:31.962
Whose fiancee it is?

02:31.963 --> 02:33.813
My brother, Jin Ming.

02:34.473 --> 02:35.493
Jin Ming?

02:35.793 --> 02:37.472
That sounds familiar.

02:37.473 --> 02:39.442
He runs the dessert shop at the crossing.

02:39.443 --> 02:40.613
It's Jin!

02:41.073 --> 02:42.333
Did he send you here?

02:42.683 --> 02:44.303
He didn't ask us to do this.

02:44.633 --> 02:48.792
We decide to come here and
teach that bastard a lesson.

02:48.793 --> 02:50.162
He said he didn't know it.

02:50.163 --> 02:50.723
He didn't know the girl.

02:50.723 --> 02:51.513
Can't you hear that?

02:51.514 --> 02:52.722
Get him out.

02:52.723 --> 02:54.192
I'll make him confess.

02:54.193 --> 02:56.682
I can tell he's
guilty from his look.

02:56.683 --> 02:57.562
Wait a second.

02:57.563 --> 02:58.962
I'll call Jin now.

02:58.963 --> 02:59.963
Just to make sure.

03:00.513 --> 03:01.703
He got his number?

03:02.193 --> 03:03.882
It must be a misunderstanding.

03:03.883 --> 03:04.722
Misunderstanding?

03:04.723 --> 03:06.613
Don't fool me around.

03:07.723 --> 03:08.912
I can tell the Northeastern accent.
Where are you from?

03:08.913 --> 03:09.722
Shenyang.

03:09.723 --> 03:10.472
Why?

03:10.473 --> 03:11.813
For real?

03:12.403 --> 03:14.613
I used to live there.

03:15.593 --> 03:16.402
Righteousness.

03:16.403 --> 03:17.543
Another virtue of my fellow man.

03:18.033 --> 03:19.093
That's right.

03:20.003 --> 03:21.032
Jin.

03:21.033 --> 03:23.562
Your three friends
here accused Hu Youyu

03:23.563 --> 03:24.512
of taking your girlfriend.

03:24.513 --> 03:25.703
They beat him up.

03:29.193 --> 03:32.512
Jin Ming's girlfriend cheated
on him for a resident singer.

03:32.513 --> 03:34.373
The one before Mr. Hu comes here.

03:34.633 --> 03:36.863
He's escaped to Lijiang by now.

03:37.593 --> 03:38.703
Thanks.

03:39.843 --> 03:40.933
Mr. Hu.

03:41.163 --> 03:42.312
Why did you run?

03:42.313 --> 03:43.613
You could talk to them.

03:44.403 --> 03:46.093
But they won't listen.

03:47.633 --> 03:48.633
I'm used to it.

03:48.723 --> 03:50.263
It's not the first time.

03:52.283 --> 03:53.543
There was one time

03:54.003 --> 03:56.282
when a girl wanted me to date her.

03:56.283 --> 03:57.613
As I asked her out,

03:57.883 --> 03:59.303
her boyfriend showed up.

04:02.473 --> 04:04.613
What should we do now?

04:05.403 --> 04:06.403
Let it be.

04:06.753 --> 04:08.143
They have the wrong guy.

04:11.153 --> 04:12.743
By the way,

04:13.073 --> 04:16.183
I feel sorry for that dude.

04:16.393 --> 04:19.103
His friends are loyal to him.

04:19.883 --> 04:22.312
As for me,
the wound is not that bad.

04:22.313 --> 04:23.343
Just walk away.

04:23.753 --> 04:24.753
No way!

04:26.513 --> 04:28.053
What do you want?

04:28.753 --> 04:29.753
Apology.

04:32.273 --> 04:33.543
It doesn't matter.

04:34.803 --> 04:37.813
Even if he apologizes,
it will change nothing.

04:38.713 --> 04:40.053
But he must do it.

04:53.633 --> 04:54.633
Well.

04:54.923 --> 04:56.272
Leave without me.

04:56.273 --> 04:57.573
It's late.

04:58.563 --> 05:01.223
I need to take a shower.

05:02.273 --> 05:03.543
It smells.

05:05.683 --> 05:06.693
Just go.

05:12.043 --> 05:13.183
Is he all right?

05:15.923 --> 05:16.933
Leave it to me.

05:22.313 --> 05:23.373
Thanks.

05:44.803 --> 05:46.303
Time to sleep. Goodnight.

05:52.683 --> 05:53.683
Xu Hongdou.

05:55.713 --> 05:57.103
What do you think of me?

05:58.123 --> 05:58.713
I said it many times.

05:58.714 --> 06:00.183
You are great.

06:04.833 --> 06:06.952
I'd love to share with
you my basic information.

06:06.953 --> 06:07.953
No, no.

06:08.833 --> 06:09.863
It's late at night.

06:10.313 --> 06:11.632
We can talk about it tomorrow.

06:11.633 --> 06:13.783
I'd love to try
the rice noodles.

06:14.073 --> 06:15.602
Then,
we can take a walk by the lake.

06:15.603 --> 06:17.103
We'll talk about it
on our way back.

06:22.393 --> 06:23.393
Okay.

06:24.393 --> 06:25.393
Goodnight.

06:26.003 --> 06:27.003
Goodnight.

06:48.123 --> 06:51.642
♫ I've been alone ♫

06:51.643 --> 06:55.482
♫ into the unknown ♫

06:55.483 --> 07:02.442
♫ Could navigate through the dark ♫

07:02.443 --> 07:06.282
♫ I'm searching for ♫

07:06.283 --> 07:09.802
♫ a meadow of mine ♫

07:09.803 --> 07:16.442
♫ Till you come in with the breeze ♫

07:16.443 --> 07:19.642
♫ A feeling rushes over me ♫

07:19.643 --> 07:24.122
♫ Spills my heart into the field ♫

07:24.123 --> 07:25.272
I disagree.

07:25.273 --> 07:26.863
I must say it now.

07:27.073 --> 07:28.602
Do you have to talk about it at night?

07:28.603 --> 07:29.933
I can't hold it.

07:31.273 --> 07:32.743
Fine, go ahead.

07:35.273 --> 07:36.273
Xu Hongdou.

07:36.633 --> 07:38.183
I have a loan right now.

07:38.633 --> 07:40.712
But I have a deposit of about 50,000 yuan.

07:40.713 --> 07:42.442
Pass, I've heard about it.

07:42.443 --> 07:43.933
Move on from the finances.

07:44.483 --> 07:46.103
I live with my Granny.

07:46.513 --> 07:47.952
My dad and my stepmom

07:47.953 --> 07:49.752
are running a flower business in Kunming.

07:49.753 --> 07:52.013
I have an innocent younger
brother who's in high school.

07:52.393 --> 07:53.783
My stepmom is very nice.

07:55.003 --> 07:56.442
I know that, too.

07:56.443 --> 07:57.443
Move on.

07:57.683 --> 07:58.683
What about yourself?

08:01.273 --> 08:02.813
I'm still young.

08:03.123 --> 08:05.223
I won't define myself
as a successful man.

08:06.243 --> 08:07.813
I own no residence in the city.

08:08.123 --> 08:10.783
Just a house from my family in the village,
a homestead,

08:11.483 --> 08:13.573
and an unknown career.

08:14.603 --> 08:16.453
I know about that more or less.

08:17.153 --> 08:19.053
I call them the prerequisite.

08:19.563 --> 08:20.573
Xu Hongdou.

08:21.483 --> 08:23.343
I've seen many people over the past years.

08:23.883 --> 08:25.453
Many good girls, to be specific.

08:26.393 --> 08:28.543
But I don't know why I don't
feel the chemical with them.

08:29.603 --> 08:31.263
None of anyone I've met before.

08:31.553 --> 08:33.023
But I felt it with you.

08:33.963 --> 08:36.263
Maybe it's because of the warmth.

08:37.243 --> 08:39.573
As you come to me,
I feel the breeze.

08:41.083 --> 08:42.093
Do you get it?

08:45.083 --> 08:46.432
I'm not sure.

08:46.433 --> 08:47.672
I think I get the hang of it.

08:47.673 --> 08:48.003
Come on.

08:48.004 --> 08:49.912
You must know it.

08:49.913 --> 08:51.792
The breeze rises, ruffling the calm river.

08:51.793 --> 08:52.793
Do you understand?

08:54.603 --> 08:55.693
Come on. Xu Hongdou.

08:56.123 --> 08:57.322
Don't play dumb with me.

08:57.323 --> 08:57.753
I get it.

08:57.754 --> 08:59.213
You want to hear more sweet words, right?

09:01.323 --> 09:02.432
Is that all?

09:02.433 --> 09:03.433
Yes.

09:04.673 --> 09:07.023
Will you... be my girlfriend?

09:08.003 --> 09:09.003
No.

09:09.793 --> 09:10.962
No?

09:10.963 --> 09:11.963
No!

09:12.793 --> 09:13.602
Come on.

09:13.603 --> 09:14.602
You turned me down the last time.

09:14.603 --> 09:15.672
Not again.

09:15.673 --> 09:17.672
Must I try three times like
Liu Bei and Zhuge Liang?

09:17.673 --> 09:18.602
I told you just now.

09:18.603 --> 09:19.962
Wait till tomorrow.

09:19.963 --> 09:23.432
Tomorrow, after we get up,
let me put my makeup on,

09:23.433 --> 09:24.792
and a lovely dress.

09:24.793 --> 09:26.392
You can do the talking by the lake.

09:26.393 --> 09:27.632
I'll agree to it.

09:27.633 --> 09:29.023
And you could get a kiss.

09:29.273 --> 09:31.082
What about now?

09:31.083 --> 09:32.083
Is that it?

09:32.883 --> 09:33.973
Xu Hongdou.

09:34.273 --> 09:35.882
Get the door open now.

09:35.883 --> 09:37.263
In your dream!

09:39.433 --> 09:40.853
Just hold it for tomorrow!

09:41.083 --> 09:42.202
Seriously, Xu Hongdou?

09:42.203 --> 09:43.082
Are you having cold feet?

09:43.083 --> 09:44.213
You are such a bad loser.

09:44.433 --> 09:45.512
Whatever you say.

09:45.513 --> 09:46.513
See you tomorrow.

09:47.323 --> 09:54.343
♫ We close our eyes to feel ♫

09:54.883 --> 09:59.183
[I'll open the door now.
Xie Zhiyao]

10:05.433 --> 10:06.482
Make it clear.

10:06.483 --> 10:08.432
What are we now?

10:08.433 --> 10:09.632
Are you nuts?

10:09.633 --> 10:10.602
Climbing up in the middle of the night?

10:10.603 --> 10:12.002
What if you fall off?

10:12.003 --> 10:13.543
You could have opened the door.

10:14.003 --> 10:14.753
Fine.

10:14.754 --> 10:15.752
I'm opening it now.

10:15.753 --> 10:16.753
Not necessary.

10:17.433 --> 10:18.272
Talk to me.

10:18.273 --> 10:19.273
Do I get a kiss?

10:20.913 --> 10:21.962
Stop laughing!

10:21.963 --> 10:23.333
Will you kiss me or not?

10:31.303 --> 10:34.082
♫ I'm staring at my phone ♫

10:34.083 --> 10:35.693
So eager, aren't you?

10:37.483 --> 10:40.163
♫ Waiting for your text ♫

10:42.673 --> 10:43.632
I told you just now.

10:43.633 --> 10:45.002
Yes.

10:45.003 --> 10:46.032
It's too high.

10:46.033 --> 10:46.633
Get downstairs.

10:46.633 --> 10:47.693
I'll open the door.

10:48.603 --> 10:49.603
Okay.

10:54.393 --> 10:55.393
What's up?

10:55.553 --> 10:57.002
I sprained my ankle.

10:57.003 --> 10:58.183
Are you okay?

10:59.033 --> 11:00.053
Xie Zhiyao?

11:15.323 --> 11:16.423
How is your ankle?

11:17.033 --> 11:18.263
Did I say that?

11:19.433 --> 11:21.042
You liar!

11:21.043 --> 11:26.142
♫ You need to validate ♫

11:26.143 --> 11:29.363
♫ Take my love for you ♫

11:31.423 --> 11:34.962
♫ It's so loud ♫

11:34.963 --> 11:39.003
♫ Beating of my heart for you ♫

11:42.393 --> 11:43.423
Xie Zhiyao.

11:43.793 --> 11:45.183
There you had it.

11:46.843 --> 11:47.903
One more time.

11:50.183 --> 11:53.422
♫ Hardly breathing ♫

11:53.423 --> 11:59.003
♫ Validation feels so near ♫

12:30.883 --> 12:31.903
Xu Hongdou.

12:36.673 --> 12:37.722
Wait a minute.

12:37.723 --> 12:38.482
Coming at you now.

12:38.483 --> 12:39.483
Sure.

12:47.793 --> 12:48.752
Come on. Let's go.

12:48.753 --> 12:49.842
The rice noodles will sell out soon.

12:49.843 --> 12:51.392
Come over.

12:51.393 --> 12:51.963
Come over.

12:51.964 --> 12:53.213
Take your time.

12:54.203 --> 12:55.602
How was your sleep last night?

12:55.603 --> 12:56.603
Bad!

12:56.913 --> 12:59.202
You texted me at three!

12:59.203 --> 13:00.512
What's wrong with you?

13:00.513 --> 13:01.733
You didn't reply!

13:02.123 --> 13:03.123
Come on.

13:03.323 --> 13:04.423
That was three a.m.!

13:04.793 --> 13:06.242
Everyone's sleeping but you.

13:06.243 --> 13:07.002
Let's go.

13:07.003 --> 13:08.003
Sure.

13:12.123 --> 13:13.623
So soon?

13:14.323 --> 13:15.323
What do you mean?

13:15.433 --> 13:16.433
Never mind.

13:17.633 --> 13:18.842
Xie Zhiyao.

13:18.843 --> 13:20.512
You have a slim waist.

13:20.513 --> 13:21.722
Stop touching me.

13:21.723 --> 13:22.632
Safety first.

13:22.633 --> 13:24.023
I love it.

13:24.273 --> 13:25.272
Time to go.

13:25.273 --> 13:25.603
Sure.

13:25.603 --> 13:26.123
Off we go!

13:26.124 --> 13:28.423
♫ On this journey, stars mark our steps ♫

13:29.143 --> 13:31.883
♫ the rainbow marks our steps, too ♫

13:33.583 --> 13:37.062
♫ We miss and we embrace ♫

13:37.063 --> 13:41.802
♫ Breeze blow over the land ♫

13:41.803 --> 13:45.063
♫ over the places with sweet secrets ♫

13:46.843 --> 13:50.003
♫ It's like a dream ♫

13:50.463 --> 13:56.283
♫ On the rainy or sunny street ♫

13:56.643 --> 13:59.862
♫ Before we say goodbye ♫

13:59.863 --> 14:03.562
♫ let's travel far ♫

14:03.563 --> 14:08.303
♫ Sometimes I need a beautiful smile ♫

14:09.063 --> 14:12.603
♫ Although the seasons go by ♫

14:13.503 --> 14:16.702
♫ Deep love like we're juvenile ♫

14:16.703 --> 14:20.823
♫ Sometimes I find I fall in love ♫

14:22.003 --> 14:23.263
I love the splendid scene!

14:23.483 --> 14:24.573
It looks vast.

14:26.633 --> 14:28.573
Do you miss the concrete jungle?

14:30.123 --> 14:31.853
Not now. Maybe later.

14:32.793 --> 14:35.093
I might be missing urban life in the future.

14:36.083 --> 14:37.842
That's what we all do.

14:37.843 --> 14:39.783
We keep changing our minds.

14:40.003 --> 14:43.213
Once we had it,
it was not attractive anymore.

14:45.793 --> 14:48.263
Once you had it,
it's not attractive anymore.

14:49.483 --> 14:51.333
Is that what girls do?

14:51.723 --> 14:53.512
I'm talking about things.

14:53.513 --> 14:55.183
Do not misinterpret.

14:56.273 --> 14:57.392
Now you're hitting me!

14:57.393 --> 14:58.813
The jig is up!

15:00.633 --> 15:01.512
I'm just kidding.

15:01.513 --> 15:02.482
Don't be serious.

15:02.483 --> 15:03.783
You're so scheming!

15:05.033 --> 15:06.853
Me? Scheming?

15:07.203 --> 15:09.392
I'm pure clear,
like spring water!

15:09.393 --> 15:10.853
How could I be scheming?

15:14.203 --> 15:17.053
To be honest,
I just found it out after returning.

15:17.483 --> 15:19.333
Before I left,

15:19.673 --> 15:22.783
why did you send me
the carved wood necklace?

15:23.323 --> 15:24.962
And the love confession by the lake.

15:24.963 --> 15:26.453
You picked a nice suit,

15:26.673 --> 15:27.882
treating me nicely.

15:27.883 --> 15:28.883
Right?

15:29.243 --> 15:32.213
You just want me to be
nostalgic when I was gone.

15:32.913 --> 15:34.543
Isn't that scheming?

15:36.003 --> 15:37.973
I didn't see nostalgia.

15:38.393 --> 15:39.962
You moved after getting back.

15:39.963 --> 15:41.962
And you kept posting moments
of the noodles your dad made,

15:41.963 --> 15:43.152
the dumplings from your mom,

15:43.153 --> 15:45.082
and your Granny's 20-year-old electric fan.

15:45.083 --> 15:46.543
You looked so happy.

15:46.753 --> 15:49.813
Not like me,
a gloomy man who just broke up.

15:50.273 --> 15:51.783
I wasn't happy!

15:52.123 --> 15:54.023
I was confused, too.

15:54.393 --> 15:56.303
I'm not into long-distance things.

15:56.673 --> 15:57.752
I understand.

15:57.753 --> 15:59.933
Living in two districts
is long-distance for you.

16:05.033 --> 16:06.903
But I must say I wavered.

16:07.273 --> 16:09.853
Maybe it's true that our
minds are always changing.

16:10.633 --> 16:13.143
The principle would be
different for various people.

16:13.913 --> 16:15.693
But I'm not a little girl.

16:16.273 --> 16:18.213
I wouldn't be reckless
when being in a relationship.

16:19.323 --> 16:21.962
I must think about the future.

16:21.963 --> 16:23.933
Find a plausible solution.

16:24.553 --> 16:26.453
Always have a plan for the future, right?

16:28.153 --> 16:28.912
Yeah.

16:28.913 --> 16:31.752
I was thinking if you
were to stay in Beijing,

16:31.753 --> 16:35.143
I would take flights from
time to time to see you.

16:35.553 --> 16:38.202
Who would have thought
that you're serious about

16:38.203 --> 16:39.933
taking over the guesthouse here.

16:41.883 --> 16:45.602
I'm telling you,
I did my research

16:45.603 --> 16:47.202
before deciding to run the guesthouse.

16:47.203 --> 16:49.322
I consulted some experts.

16:49.323 --> 16:51.122
I wasn't sure about it.

16:51.123 --> 16:52.752
It was the news of
the bookstore's coming

16:52.753 --> 16:54.482
that drove me to this decision.

16:54.483 --> 16:56.383
And there was my cousin.

16:56.723 --> 17:01.042
Her accident taught me
that I should hesitate no more.

17:01.043 --> 17:02.432
Life is full of accidents.

17:02.433 --> 17:06.152
I don't want to waste my time overthinking

17:06.153 --> 17:07.423
in the midst of worries.

17:08.083 --> 17:10.143
Unpredictable, that's life.

17:10.633 --> 17:11.633
Don't you think?

17:13.043 --> 17:14.063
Xie Zhiyao.

17:14.843 --> 17:16.152
You are one of the reasons.

17:16.153 --> 17:17.973
But you're not the sole one.

17:20.673 --> 17:23.152
I made this decision for myself,
too.

17:23.153 --> 17:24.952
I will take up the consequence.

17:24.953 --> 17:26.583
You don't have to worry about that.

17:28.803 --> 17:30.863
Don't exclude me from your life.

17:31.153 --> 17:32.933
I will take up the responsibility.

17:33.323 --> 17:34.583
You've come here.

17:34.843 --> 17:37.522
As your boyfriend,
and the most handsome man in the village,

17:37.523 --> 17:38.973
I must take care of you.

17:39.283 --> 17:41.423
We are responsible for each others' shoulders.

17:42.673 --> 17:44.533
You're responsible for my shoulder.

17:44.843 --> 17:47.493
But I insist on taking full responsibility
for you.

17:54.283 --> 17:56.383
When can you notice my presence?

17:56.763 --> 17:57.973
Qin?

17:58.523 --> 17:59.733
Candy!

18:01.913 --> 18:02.913
Hongdou.

18:04.803 --> 18:07.293
How will I make a man
taking the responsibility for me?

18:08.473 --> 18:09.762
That's so weird.

18:09.763 --> 18:12.143
I never hear these
words from Yang Zhinan.

18:14.523 --> 18:16.063
That's hard to say.

18:17.283 --> 18:20.623
Could it be that he's shy
for being inferior to me?

18:21.323 --> 18:22.323
Qin.

18:22.633 --> 18:23.912
Shouldn't you be doing farmwork now?

18:23.913 --> 18:24.973
You should get going.

18:26.433 --> 18:27.433
So upset.

18:28.193 --> 18:29.193
Goodbye.

18:39.233 --> 18:40.209
Come on.

18:40.233 --> 18:41.533
Time to work.

18:46.193 --> 18:47.193
Your purse.

18:47.563 --> 18:50.232
It's a great day today!

18:50.233 --> 18:51.973
Yeah, a full day!

19:02.123 --> 19:03.533
How old is this residence?

19:04.563 --> 19:07.143
I'm afraid it's very old.

19:07.393 --> 19:08.282
It's an ancestral residence.

19:08.283 --> 19:09.863
It's been here for a century.

19:10.433 --> 19:13.082
These years,
most villagers make enough money

19:13.083 --> 19:14.522
and rebuild their houses.

19:14.523 --> 19:17.082
As for this family,
their great-grandpa made his fortune

19:17.083 --> 19:17.673
by running a pack horse team.

19:17.674 --> 19:18.823
He built this family.

19:19.083 --> 19:21.952
Later,
his family fortune declined.

19:21.953 --> 19:23.882
They couldn't afford to rebuild it.

19:23.883 --> 19:27.583
They keep patching up
the house year after year.

19:28.153 --> 19:29.712
Now it's an old estate.

19:29.713 --> 19:31.823
It's hard to maintain an old residence.

19:32.563 --> 19:33.693
This place is great.

19:34.763 --> 19:36.773
Do you like it here?

19:38.193 --> 19:39.762
I've seen many places.

19:39.763 --> 19:42.122
Some are farmlands,
where residential use is prohibited.

19:42.123 --> 19:43.522
Others are occupied.

19:43.523 --> 19:44.952
This is just what I want.

19:44.953 --> 19:46.082
It's spacious.

19:46.083 --> 19:47.042
And it's got stories.

19:47.043 --> 19:48.293
We can renovate it.

19:49.083 --> 19:51.882
The only shortcoming is it's
on the far side of the village.

19:51.883 --> 19:52.912
Cars can't reach here.

19:52.913 --> 19:54.423
They'd have to walk here.

19:57.473 --> 19:58.473
President Zhang.

19:58.563 --> 19:59.762
A quiz.

19:59.763 --> 20:00.602
What's it about?

20:00.603 --> 20:02.042
Just now,
I saw Qinglian's legacy

20:02.043 --> 20:03.282
on a neighbor's spirit screen.

20:03.283 --> 20:04.293
What's their family name?

20:04.843 --> 20:05.863
Li, from the great poet Li Bai.

20:06.233 --> 20:07.423
What about innocence and honesty?

20:07.713 --> 20:08.672
The familiy name is Yang.

20:08.673 --> 20:10.013
What about quiet sea and clear rivers?

20:11.433 --> 20:12.433
That...

20:12.563 --> 20:14.232
That's not about the family name.

20:14.233 --> 20:16.392
That means a good
environment in the neighborhood.

20:16.393 --> 20:17.153
Quiet sea and clear rivers.

20:17.154 --> 20:19.693
It's a harmonious
time with a peaceful life.

20:20.393 --> 20:20.883
Intriguing.

20:20.884 --> 20:22.293
I'll search for more.

20:23.713 --> 20:24.473
She's newly grad.

20:24.473 --> 20:25.533
Feisty.

20:28.913 --> 20:29.913
Good for her.

20:30.363 --> 20:35.383
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

20:37.803 --> 20:42.263
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

20:44.283 --> 20:45.232
No problem.

20:45.233 --> 20:46.233
I'll sign it.

20:47.153 --> 20:48.122
On the last page.

20:48.123 --> 20:49.143
Party B.

20:49.763 --> 20:50.323
Here?

20:50.323 --> 20:51.323
Exactly.

20:51.563 --> 20:57.243
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

20:59.843 --> 21:02.912
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

21:02.913 --> 21:03.913
There you go.

21:07.343 --> 21:12.123
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

21:14.683 --> 21:18.842
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

21:18.843 --> 21:20.693
Get the mailman here.

21:21.193 --> 21:22.632
Boss Li and the landlord

21:22.633 --> 21:23.882
will send the contracts back after signing them.

21:23.883 --> 21:26.282
We need to remit the money
within seven business days.

21:26.283 --> 21:27.933
Sure. I'll head to work.

21:28.603 --> 21:29.043
There's one more contract.

21:29.044 --> 21:30.733
It's our partnership agreement.

21:31.223 --> 21:35.672
♫ The changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

21:35.673 --> 21:36.773
Should I sign here?

21:37.233 --> 21:38.632
Take a look first!

21:38.633 --> 21:39.522
My dad checked on it.

21:39.523 --> 21:40.823
He said it was okay.

21:41.123 --> 21:42.082
Hold on.

21:42.083 --> 21:43.912
Take a picture
and send it to him.

21:43.913 --> 21:45.533
What if I changed the clauses?

21:47.523 --> 21:49.383
You know why I want to collaborate with you?

21:50.603 --> 21:53.253
Professional, reliable,
and trustworthy.

21:53.883 --> 21:56.183
[Party A: Lin Na.]

21:58.633 --> 21:59.762
Take a look when you have time.

21:59.763 --> 22:07.289
♫ Go to a windy place to meet you ♫

22:07.633 --> 22:08.633
Sure.

22:08.883 --> 22:10.693
I must hurry to work.

22:11.603 --> 22:12.762
This one is yours.

22:12.763 --> 22:13.903
I'll take this copy.

22:20.283 --> 22:23.282
Here we are at the
second place in the promo.

22:23.283 --> 22:26.253
Woodcarving workshop!

22:26.713 --> 22:27.773
Look behind me.

22:28.153 --> 22:31.392
The handsome craftsman is here, too!

22:31.393 --> 22:34.522
We really get lucky for this
journey following the promo.

22:34.523 --> 22:35.842
Let's greet the craftsman.

22:35.843 --> 22:36.843
Come on.

22:38.083 --> 22:38.803
Hello.

22:38.804 --> 22:40.192
Excuse me.

22:40.193 --> 22:41.193
Hi.

22:41.633 --> 22:42.882
May I have your name?

22:42.883 --> 22:43.883
Xiaxia.

22:44.193 --> 22:45.193
Xiaxia.

22:45.283 --> 22:46.432
Allow me to introduce myself.

22:46.433 --> 22:47.392
I'm Luo Li the Hiker.

22:47.393 --> 22:48.432
I'm a travel vlogger.

22:48.433 --> 22:49.762
This is my team.

22:49.763 --> 22:50.763
Hello.

22:50.953 --> 22:54.082
We saw the promo about
your village on the internet.

22:54.083 --> 22:54.843
It looks great.

22:54.844 --> 22:55.912
But I didn't see many posts.

22:55.913 --> 22:58.383
So,
we are here to visit the iconic place in the promo.

22:59.193 --> 23:00.213
Welcome.

23:01.283 --> 23:02.773
He's so cute.

23:04.193 --> 23:05.773
What is this carving about?

23:06.153 --> 23:07.153
Lotus.

23:07.883 --> 23:09.343
Lotus.

23:11.123 --> 23:12.432
It's quite large.

23:12.433 --> 23:13.583
What is this for?

23:14.283 --> 23:15.423
To hang on the wall.

23:17.153 --> 23:18.583
It's a decoration!

23:19.153 --> 23:20.453
It looks amazing.

23:23.713 --> 23:25.122
You are live streaming, too!

23:25.123 --> 23:25.952
Yeah.

23:25.953 --> 23:27.383
I have few viewers.

23:31.393 --> 23:34.143
Viewers online, 22.

23:34.673 --> 23:38.693
The account is
Hardworking Xiaxia.

23:39.763 --> 23:41.842
That's Hardworking Xiaxia.

23:41.843 --> 23:43.562
Don't forget to like and
subscribe for more of his videos.

23:43.563 --> 23:44.712
He's so cute.

23:44.713 --> 23:45.863
Hi, guys.

23:46.153 --> 23:46.603
Hello.

23:46.604 --> 23:47.432
Your smoothie is ready.

23:47.433 --> 23:47.912
Thanks.

23:47.913 --> 23:48.913
Bye.

24:02.393 --> 24:03.322
Lady.

24:03.323 --> 24:04.383
This calms you down.

24:10.433 --> 24:11.433
Hey, child.

24:11.803 --> 24:12.803
Come here.

24:19.323 --> 24:20.423
Thanks.

24:25.803 --> 24:26.863
What's that...

24:40.123 --> 24:41.152
Engineer Zhang and President Zhao

24:41.153 --> 24:43.152
really like this residence.

24:43.153 --> 24:45.122
It's spacious and
it's an old estate.

24:45.123 --> 24:47.152
They will renovate
it in a protective way.

24:47.153 --> 24:51.143
The only problem is
the location of this house.

24:51.673 --> 24:53.122
Yeah, I can see.

24:53.123 --> 24:54.693
The shuttle bus couldn't reach here.

24:54.993 --> 24:55.882
The road is narrow.

24:55.883 --> 24:56.603
Cars can't get in.

24:56.603 --> 24:57.603
We have to go on foot.

24:58.673 --> 25:00.013
From another perspective,

25:00.323 --> 25:01.323
look at that.

25:02.633 --> 25:05.602
If we get out of the house,
the guesthouse is on the left.

25:05.603 --> 25:07.063
Tie-dye workshop on the right.

25:07.433 --> 25:08.762
It's a small village.

25:08.763 --> 25:09.882
These places are clustered.

25:09.883 --> 25:11.733
Walking is the easiest way.

25:13.953 --> 25:16.802
Just like the theater,
which often lies on the top floor

25:16.803 --> 25:17.762
in malls.

25:17.763 --> 25:20.472
When you head for a movie,
you'd stop by other shops.

25:20.473 --> 25:21.773
That's the point.

25:22.473 --> 25:23.912
Sure. I'll talk to them.

25:23.913 --> 25:24.392
Okay.

25:24.393 --> 25:25.083
Work on that.

25:25.084 --> 25:26.082
Talk to them.

25:26.083 --> 25:28.232
I'll treat Engineer
Zhang to dinner at night.

25:28.233 --> 25:29.129
Sure.

25:29.153 --> 25:30.122
It's about time.

25:30.123 --> 25:31.122
I should pick up my Granny.

25:31.123 --> 25:31.952
Sure, off you go.

25:31.953 --> 25:32.433
I'll get going.

25:32.434 --> 25:33.773
- Bye-bye.
- Bye-bye.

25:40.153 --> 25:41.602
Granny.

25:41.603 --> 25:44.213
What will we have for the meal?

25:44.473 --> 25:45.823
What do you want?

25:46.283 --> 25:47.973
I want...

25:49.043 --> 25:50.322
fried beef.

25:50.323 --> 25:51.392
Sure.

25:51.393 --> 25:53.423
Fried beef it is.

25:54.633 --> 25:56.013
Then some vegetables.

26:06.193 --> 26:07.193
Yao.

26:08.153 --> 26:10.253
Who sent the rick cake?

26:10.993 --> 26:12.253
It's from Xu Hongdou.

26:12.563 --> 26:14.432
We made some rice cakes
as we were making rice wine

26:14.433 --> 26:15.903
at Aunt Baoping's.

26:16.603 --> 26:18.623
Invite her for dinner.

26:20.193 --> 26:21.322
I tried.

26:21.323 --> 26:22.323
But she wouldn't come.

26:23.803 --> 26:27.693
Why doesn't she eat here this time?

26:28.633 --> 26:31.453
She said she's shy.

26:31.993 --> 26:34.343
Why would she?

26:49.433 --> 26:51.293
Did you get a girlfriend?

26:54.153 --> 26:56.063
I can't believe that.

26:58.673 --> 26:59.632
Just go.

26:59.633 --> 27:01.082
Invite her for dinner.

27:01.083 --> 27:01.672
Hurry.

27:01.673 --> 27:02.579
What?

27:02.603 --> 27:03.602
Hold on.

27:03.603 --> 27:05.322
If she shows up,
do not poke around.

27:05.323 --> 27:06.802
Yeah, I won't.

27:06.803 --> 27:08.082
It's just dinner.

27:08.083 --> 27:09.152
Why would I poke around?

27:09.153 --> 27:09.433
Yeah, sure.

27:09.433 --> 27:09.913
Hurry up.

27:09.914 --> 27:11.213
Okay.

27:24.283 --> 27:25.283
Hongdou.

27:25.993 --> 27:29.063
What is it in Yao
that attracts you?

27:32.803 --> 27:33.973
Everything.

27:34.283 --> 27:35.283
Most importantly,

27:36.433 --> 27:37.433
he's handsome.

27:40.523 --> 27:42.712
You are just like me when I was young.

27:42.713 --> 27:43.713
Really?

27:44.233 --> 27:45.733
His grandpa

27:45.953 --> 27:47.952
was very attractive.

27:47.953 --> 27:49.322
More handsome than him!

27:49.323 --> 27:50.432
His eyes were bigger.

27:50.433 --> 27:54.042
It's a pity there wasn't a picture
of him when he was young.

27:54.043 --> 27:54.912
Granny.

27:54.913 --> 27:55.673
We're not interested

27:55.674 --> 27:57.583
in the stories between you and my grandpa.

27:58.193 --> 27:59.432
I am!

27:59.433 --> 28:00.533
What about later?

28:01.083 --> 28:03.383
Later? He grew old and grew ugly.

28:04.283 --> 28:06.183
When Yao gets old,

28:06.523 --> 28:08.013
he'd be uglier.

28:11.953 --> 28:13.082
Granny.

28:13.083 --> 28:14.392
You can just sit aside.

28:14.393 --> 28:16.282
Do not do me a disservice, please.

28:16.283 --> 28:17.453
I'll keep my mouth shut.

28:18.083 --> 28:19.083
Let's eat.

28:20.283 --> 28:21.383
Uglier.

28:24.563 --> 28:24.953
Granny.

28:24.954 --> 28:25.952
Stop picking food for her.

28:25.953 --> 28:27.213
She can do it herself.

28:28.233 --> 28:30.632
I haven't used my chopsticks. They're clean!

28:30.633 --> 28:31.992
It's not about that.

28:31.993 --> 28:32.882
Take a look at her bowl.

28:32.883 --> 28:33.842
I can't see any rice.

28:33.843 --> 28:34.603
Covered with dishes.

28:34.603 --> 28:35.393
Just eat.

28:35.393 --> 28:36.423
Don't mind her.

28:36.883 --> 28:37.903
Have some more.

28:38.473 --> 28:40.103
She'd be stuffed.

28:40.843 --> 28:42.192
That's not much!

28:42.193 --> 28:44.322
When I was young...
When you were young,

28:44.323 --> 28:45.602
you did labor work.

28:45.603 --> 28:46.733
It's not the same.

28:48.803 --> 28:49.973
Here.

28:50.193 --> 28:50.992
Granny.

28:50.993 --> 28:52.152
There isn't much beef.

28:52.153 --> 28:53.282
Save some for me, please.

28:53.283 --> 28:53.713
I really want it.

28:53.714 --> 28:55.232
I know what to do.

28:55.233 --> 28:56.233
Give it to me.

28:56.673 --> 28:58.472
You're so possessive!

28:58.473 --> 28:59.432
Granny.

28:59.433 --> 29:01.293
That's new to me.

29:01.673 --> 29:03.423
Am I your biological grandson?

29:04.283 --> 29:06.533
Here. This is yours.

29:29.393 --> 29:31.623
I'm alone again.

29:32.043 --> 29:34.063
It's good to be in love.

29:39.563 --> 29:41.082
Hello, Xin.

29:41.083 --> 29:42.122
Nana! I'm sorry!

29:42.123 --> 29:44.322
I forgot to turn off the tap in the bathroom.

29:44.323 --> 29:44.913
What should we do?

29:44.914 --> 29:46.493
Shall I get back now?

29:47.843 --> 29:48.882
Fine.

29:48.883 --> 29:49.952
I'll take care of it.

29:49.953 --> 29:50.713
Just stay at home.

29:50.713 --> 29:51.733
I'll do it.

30:09.153 --> 30:10.882
What a mess!

30:10.883 --> 30:11.933
What's wrong, Nana?

30:13.393 --> 30:14.322
It's the new employee.

30:14.323 --> 30:15.562
She's so careless.

30:15.563 --> 30:18.152
I asked her to clean the
counter before she leaves.

30:18.153 --> 30:19.992
Turned out,
she forgot to turn off the tap.

30:19.993 --> 30:21.693
She called me after getting home.

30:22.523 --> 30:23.522
Leave it to me.

30:23.523 --> 30:24.283
Stay outside.

30:24.283 --> 30:24.843
I can handle it.

30:24.843 --> 30:25.843
It's flooded.

30:32.043 --> 30:33.282
I'm on my way home.

30:33.283 --> 30:34.562
I saw the light on here.

30:34.563 --> 30:35.863
Just to take a look.

30:40.603 --> 30:41.322
Well.

30:41.323 --> 30:42.823
Did you have dinner?

30:43.523 --> 30:44.523
Nope.

30:44.713 --> 30:46.522
I can make you fry rice. Will that do?

30:46.523 --> 30:47.042
Sure.

30:47.043 --> 30:48.043
Thanks.

30:48.123 --> 30:49.123
No problem.

30:53.523 --> 30:54.282
Here you go.

30:54.283 --> 30:55.283
Thanks.

31:20.603 --> 31:21.773
You can wear mine.

31:22.523 --> 31:23.733
What about you?

31:23.953 --> 31:24.522
Don't worry.

31:24.523 --> 31:25.562
Barefoot is fine.

31:25.563 --> 31:26.773
That's not.

31:28.283 --> 31:29.423
I don't have foot fungus.

31:29.713 --> 31:31.103
Should I flush them for you?

31:31.393 --> 31:33.253
I'm not worried about that.

31:34.323 --> 31:35.323
Just put them on.

31:35.563 --> 31:37.063
Girls are like flowers.

31:57.563 --> 31:59.343
I just find out

31:59.563 --> 32:00.773
you've grown up.

32:01.233 --> 32:04.933
Xiaochun said you are calmer
and more sedate than before.

32:05.843 --> 32:07.213
That's not a compliment.

32:07.563 --> 32:08.802
I'm 22 now!

32:08.803 --> 32:10.383
I mean it.

32:12.283 --> 32:14.863
Maybe, everyone experiences it.

32:15.153 --> 32:17.623
Before we realize it,
we are free of childishness.

32:18.123 --> 32:19.152
I used to think that

32:19.153 --> 32:21.602
you're like President Xie's younger brother.

32:21.603 --> 32:24.143
But now, you look like a man.

32:28.993 --> 32:30.623
I... I am a man.

32:33.393 --> 32:34.369
By the way,

32:34.393 --> 32:36.392
when you are free,
make a Guan Yu sculpture for me.

32:36.393 --> 32:37.882
Made it with nice wood.

32:37.883 --> 32:39.583
I'll lay it in the hall of our guestroom.

32:40.393 --> 32:41.393
No problem!

32:41.673 --> 32:42.579
Well.

32:42.603 --> 32:46.933
If you run the guestroom with Hongdou,
will you stay?

32:47.323 --> 32:48.323
I will not.

32:49.393 --> 32:50.393
Wouldn't you?

32:50.953 --> 32:51.912
No.

32:51.913 --> 32:54.602
President Xu sets a goal
to open more guestrooms.

32:54.603 --> 32:57.903
When we made the plan,
we wanted to make it a chain brand.

32:58.673 --> 33:00.423
One day, maybe,

33:00.713 --> 33:02.903
we'll have a new
guestroom in another village.

33:03.713 --> 33:08.063
As the deputy president,
I might run the branch guestroom.

33:10.713 --> 33:11.882
You can go wherever you want to.

33:11.883 --> 33:12.883
I admire that.

33:13.393 --> 33:14.393
Xiaxia.

33:15.043 --> 33:18.282
If you have the chance,
be sure to take a look

33:18.283 --> 33:19.602
at the outside world.

33:19.603 --> 33:21.933
That way,
you'll have a broad vision.

33:24.043 --> 33:25.232
The business is good now.

33:25.233 --> 33:26.493
I'm not in the mood for that.

33:27.473 --> 33:29.282
But, if you want to keep up,

33:29.283 --> 33:31.632
you must adapt to the ever-changing world.

33:31.633 --> 33:36.533
Setting in your way,
the world will leave you behind.

33:37.563 --> 33:38.693
Yao says the same thing.

33:41.803 --> 33:43.103
So,

33:43.633 --> 33:45.183
brave young man,

33:45.523 --> 33:47.802
try to find your way in the
world where everything perishes.

33:47.803 --> 33:50.183
Fight until the very last minute.

33:51.633 --> 33:52.392
How is it?

33:52.393 --> 33:53.453
Is it good?

33:54.043 --> 33:55.043
Tasty.

33:55.123 --> 33:56.123
Keep eating.

34:02.883 --> 34:03.513
Go on.

34:03.513 --> 34:04.513
I'm eating!

34:13.593 --> 34:15.543
This street is quiet. Right?

34:15.843 --> 34:16.843
That way.

34:17.283 --> 34:19.623
There are many restaurants.

34:20.283 --> 34:22.992
I see many local residents here.

34:22.993 --> 34:24.773
Yeah, most of them live around here.

34:26.033 --> 34:26.722
This way.

34:26.723 --> 34:27.723
Okay.

34:28.683 --> 34:29.683
After you.

34:30.883 --> 34:33.183
[Under construction]

34:45.033 --> 34:45.912
You know what?

34:45.913 --> 34:47.512
I trust in you as our foreman.

34:47.513 --> 34:49.202
You've been doing this for over 20 years.

34:49.203 --> 34:51.992
Those who work with you,
the carpenters, the bricklayers

34:51.993 --> 34:53.032
are really experienced.

34:53.033 --> 34:55.072
You did a great
job with our yard.

34:55.073 --> 34:56.512
Thanks for saying that.

34:56.513 --> 34:59.322
As for my girlfriend,
she didn't live here.

34:59.323 --> 35:01.392
She doesn't know the courtesy here.

35:01.393 --> 35:02.592
Just call me if
you need anything.

35:02.593 --> 35:03.593
I'll handle it.

35:03.883 --> 35:04.512
Sure.

35:04.513 --> 35:06.733
I'll assemble my men soon.

35:07.033 --> 35:08.033
Sure.

35:08.433 --> 35:09.583
Thank you.

35:12.163 --> 35:13.183
President Xu.

35:13.473 --> 35:14.693
You got a package.

35:15.643 --> 35:16.853
Is it from Yunnan?

35:18.033 --> 35:19.293
Shandong.

35:22.553 --> 35:23.472
Thanks.

35:23.473 --> 35:24.473
Okay.

35:47.723 --> 35:48.952
Pork is much cheaper now.

35:48.953 --> 35:51.282
People line up at the
market to buy minced meat

35:51.283 --> 35:52.583
for making sausages at home.

35:53.643 --> 35:53.953
Mom.

35:53.953 --> 35:54.683
But it's summer now.

35:54.684 --> 35:55.802
We don't do that in summer.

35:55.803 --> 35:56.853
It would go bad.

35:58.073 --> 35:59.392
Everyone's doing it.

35:59.393 --> 36:00.882
Thanks to technology,

36:00.883 --> 36:02.802
the store would fill the sausages for you.

36:02.803 --> 36:04.842
You just need to dry them.

36:04.843 --> 36:07.112
I put ice bags in
the package for you.

36:07.113 --> 36:09.282
Store them in the fridge.

36:09.283 --> 36:10.893
It won't go bad.

36:11.283 --> 36:13.392
That's too much!

36:13.393 --> 36:15.023
Don't get that habit from Xu Hongdou.

36:15.593 --> 36:17.842
I just sent 10 kilograms to you.

36:17.843 --> 36:19.392
Hongdou asked for 20 kilograms.

36:19.393 --> 36:20.623
And that's not enough.

36:21.163 --> 36:21.912
Well.

36:21.913 --> 36:23.693
Send them to your mother-in-law, your aunt,

36:24.203 --> 36:26.472
your colleagues and friends.

36:26.473 --> 36:27.983
Share the sausages with them.

36:28.913 --> 36:31.392
Mom, don't eat too many sausages.

36:31.393 --> 36:33.992
Eat more fresh meat if you want.

36:33.993 --> 36:35.592
I understand.

36:35.593 --> 36:37.202
There isn't any left at home.

36:37.203 --> 36:38.952
I've sent them to you.

36:38.953 --> 36:42.722
By the way, how's dad's work?

36:42.723 --> 36:44.722
Did Li Yulin arrange it?

36:44.723 --> 36:45.952
Yeah!

36:45.953 --> 36:48.242
Your dad is so delighted now.

36:48.243 --> 36:50.322
He's obsessed with his work.

36:50.323 --> 36:52.112
He used to be self-employed.

36:52.113 --> 36:53.842
He never had any colleagues.

36:53.843 --> 36:56.762
Now he keeps talking about his colleagues,

36:56.763 --> 37:00.893
neighbors and friends
he met in the mall.

37:01.433 --> 37:04.293
He's never tired of it.

37:06.763 --> 37:08.143
That's good news.

37:08.883 --> 37:11.333
He'd be in good health
when he's in a good mood.

37:13.033 --> 37:13.763
I'm telling you.

37:13.764 --> 37:16.333
We must thank Li Yulin for this.

37:18.033 --> 37:19.642
The millet looks great, right?

37:19.643 --> 37:20.853
Take a look.

37:21.163 --> 37:22.242
The color the bright.

37:22.243 --> 37:23.543
Do you know its origin?

37:23.763 --> 37:25.503
It's from Qinzhou.

37:25.843 --> 37:27.202
That's in Shanxi.

37:27.203 --> 37:28.802
Great quality.

37:28.803 --> 37:31.242
This type of millet is
perfect for making porridge.

37:31.243 --> 37:34.072
It makes the congee
very thick with a rich flavor.

37:34.073 --> 37:34.643
Is that so?

37:34.643 --> 37:35.393
Would you like some?

37:35.393 --> 37:36.072
How many do you want?

37:36.073 --> 37:36.802
One kilogram.

37:36.803 --> 37:38.543
Sure. One kilogram, right?

37:40.883 --> 37:42.023
Yeah.

37:49.763 --> 37:50.512
Good to go.

37:50.513 --> 37:51.513
This way.

37:53.993 --> 37:55.162
Exactly one kilogram.

37:55.163 --> 37:56.503
Really?

37:57.033 --> 37:59.853
65306.

38:02.473 --> 38:03.472
You know what.

38:03.473 --> 38:07.202
I can really weigh
with my hands.

38:07.203 --> 38:07.993
There you go. One kilogram.

38:07.993 --> 38:08.553
Impressive.

38:08.553 --> 38:09.033
Thanks.

38:09.034 --> 38:09.992
Come back again.

38:09.993 --> 38:10.473
Okay.

38:10.473 --> 38:11.473
Thanks.

38:13.843 --> 38:14.843
Xu!

38:16.073 --> 38:17.143
Hu!

38:17.643 --> 38:18.762
Good to see you.

38:18.763 --> 38:20.112
Did you get the vegetables on sale?

38:20.113 --> 38:20.803
Of course.

38:20.803 --> 38:21.552
Great.

38:21.553 --> 38:23.322
I didn't see you this morning
kicking shuttlecock.

38:23.323 --> 38:24.202
I'm busy.

38:24.203 --> 38:24.683
See?

38:24.684 --> 38:26.623
I got reemployed!

38:26.883 --> 38:27.882
Is that necessary?

38:27.883 --> 38:29.373
You don't need the money!

38:29.683 --> 38:30.912
I love to work.

38:30.913 --> 38:34.032
My second daughter's
colleague gets this job for me.

38:34.033 --> 38:35.552
You should retire.

38:35.553 --> 38:36.392
You don't get it.

38:36.393 --> 38:38.552
I enjoy working.

38:38.553 --> 38:39.552
What can I get for you?

38:39.553 --> 38:40.392
I'd like some red beans.

38:40.393 --> 38:43.322
My granddaughter wants
some red bean buns.

38:43.323 --> 38:44.323
Sure.

38:46.073 --> 38:46.882
Are two packs enough?

38:46.883 --> 38:48.202
Yeah, that's enough.

38:48.203 --> 38:48.992
Hu.

38:48.993 --> 38:50.202
You keep kicking the shuttlecock.

38:50.203 --> 38:50.913
How's your hamstring?

38:50.914 --> 38:52.282
Pig's feet will do you good.

38:52.283 --> 38:53.202
Cut it off.

38:53.203 --> 38:54.853
You never get tired, don't you?

39:17.073 --> 39:18.373
You're at home!

39:19.913 --> 39:21.162
Granny!

39:21.163 --> 39:22.882
Are you on your own?

39:22.883 --> 39:24.293
My mom goes to the fields.

39:24.803 --> 39:25.472
Over here.

39:25.473 --> 39:27.103
Allow me to introduce her.

39:27.323 --> 39:29.213
This is Xu Hongdou.

39:29.433 --> 39:30.282
She's your new neighbor.

39:30.283 --> 39:33.072
She rents the guesthouse.

39:33.073 --> 39:35.032
It's now being renovated.

39:35.033 --> 39:37.023
It might be loud.

39:37.553 --> 39:38.282
Hi.

39:38.283 --> 39:39.432
It's my pleasure.

39:39.433 --> 39:40.912
Just call me Hongdou.

39:40.913 --> 39:42.802
We'll be neighbors.

39:42.803 --> 39:44.432
We could help each other out.

39:44.433 --> 39:46.333
Please tell me if
there's any problem.

39:46.803 --> 39:47.803
It's fine.

39:47.953 --> 39:50.213
They are very nice.

39:51.033 --> 39:51.803
The first time we meet.

39:51.804 --> 39:53.253
I bring you some gifts.

39:53.763 --> 39:54.722
Don't bother.

39:54.723 --> 39:55.592
Just take them.

39:55.593 --> 39:56.722
We've brought these here.

39:56.723 --> 39:57.723
You must take them.

40:00.203 --> 40:01.202
Thanks.

40:01.203 --> 40:02.552
We should get going.

40:02.553 --> 40:02.953
Bye.

40:02.953 --> 40:03.953
Watch your step.

40:07.683 --> 40:08.773
Bye.

40:15.073 --> 40:16.333
Come on.

40:33.113 --> 40:34.072
Just go back.

40:34.073 --> 40:34.882
We'll carry on.

40:34.883 --> 40:36.472
Take care.

40:36.473 --> 40:36.723
Bye.

40:36.724 --> 40:37.592
Be sure to drop by.

40:37.593 --> 40:38.593
Sure.

40:49.553 --> 40:50.853
Is he home?

40:51.393 --> 40:52.893
I suppose so.

40:53.513 --> 40:54.543
Grandpa Yang?

40:57.643 --> 40:58.693
Grandpa Yang!

41:00.163 --> 41:00.883
This bookstore

41:00.884 --> 41:03.552
will attract tourists and be highly profitable.

41:03.553 --> 41:05.952
What's more,
it will provide dozens of jobs.

41:05.953 --> 41:08.893
And it stimulates the sale of artifacts.

41:18.953 --> 41:21.242
That's the basic information.

41:21.243 --> 41:21.953
Grandpa Yang.

41:21.954 --> 41:23.512
We've been talking.

41:23.513 --> 41:25.143
What do you think?

41:26.473 --> 41:27.893
What do I think?

41:28.393 --> 41:29.393
Three words.

41:30.203 --> 41:31.203
Not for sale.

41:31.323 --> 41:33.063
We want to rent it.

41:33.553 --> 41:35.023
Three words.

41:35.513 --> 41:36.513
Not for rent.

41:37.593 --> 41:39.072
How is that so?

41:39.073 --> 41:40.503
Four words.

41:41.843 --> 41:43.023
I don't want to.

41:44.723 --> 41:45.723
Grandpa Yang.

41:46.163 --> 41:48.072
There must be a reason.

41:48.073 --> 41:49.552
No one's living in
that ancient residence.

41:49.553 --> 41:53.202
If that is so, by renting it,
you could make some money.

41:53.203 --> 41:54.203
Is that right?

41:55.323 --> 41:56.592
I don't need money.

41:56.593 --> 41:57.762
My son gives me money.

41:57.763 --> 41:58.763
I don't need it.

42:00.843 --> 42:01.722
What about your grandson?

42:01.723 --> 42:02.882
The tuition fee for college.

42:02.883 --> 42:03.682
What if he gets married?

42:03.683 --> 42:04.943
He'll need money.

42:05.913 --> 42:07.543
Yao, look at yourself.

42:07.883 --> 42:08.883
And there's you.

42:09.283 --> 42:12.893
A new graduate
becomes an officer.

42:13.593 --> 42:15.183
Take a look.

42:15.803 --> 42:17.813
You've been so busy.

42:18.073 --> 42:20.413
What have you done to the village?

42:20.883 --> 42:24.213
Now you're talking about
tourism and development.

42:24.553 --> 42:26.693
I don't like those tourists

42:27.073 --> 42:29.392
with their cameras.

42:29.393 --> 42:30.983
They take pictures everywhere.

42:32.203 --> 42:33.432
What about now?

42:33.433 --> 42:34.583
A bookstore?

42:35.553 --> 42:38.413
All you think about is making money now!

42:39.283 --> 42:40.813
You've heard my thought.

42:41.163 --> 42:42.163
Three words.

42:42.513 --> 42:43.513
Not for rent.

43:02.763 --> 43:04.432
I couldn't believe Grandpa Yang

43:04.433 --> 43:05.893
defines us as profit-seeking.

43:06.763 --> 43:08.733
I didn't expect that, either.

43:09.433 --> 43:10.682
It's supposed to be a great business.

43:10.683 --> 43:11.842
It's for the common good.

43:11.843 --> 43:15.063
I thought this should be the easy part.

43:15.393 --> 43:16.393
It's okay.

43:16.473 --> 43:18.893
I'll talk to his family later.

43:19.553 --> 43:20.553
Fine.

43:20.643 --> 43:21.952
Do you have their numbers?

43:21.953 --> 43:22.393
I don't.

43:22.394 --> 43:23.642
I can look them up in the office.

43:23.643 --> 43:24.983
Yang Guanjun must have it.

43:26.203 --> 43:27.203
Okay.

43:29.683 --> 43:31.183
Hongdou and Granny.

43:33.283 --> 43:34.992
The guesthouse is under construction.

43:34.993 --> 43:36.552
I asked Granny to show Hongdou around

43:36.553 --> 43:39.413
and greet the neighbors with gifts.

43:40.243 --> 43:41.333
Hongdou!

43:42.393 --> 43:43.033
Xinxin.

43:43.033 --> 43:43.802
What a coincidence!

43:43.803 --> 43:44.553
Really?

43:44.554 --> 43:46.183
It's a small village.

43:47.883 --> 43:49.143
Have you finished?

43:49.593 --> 43:50.593
This is the second to last stop.

43:50.763 --> 43:52.413
Have you visited Deqing?

43:52.683 --> 43:53.853
Is he home?

43:55.033 --> 43:56.162
Deqing isn't home now.

43:56.163 --> 43:57.472
There's only Grandpa Yang.

43:57.473 --> 43:58.682
Do not get in now.

43:58.683 --> 43:59.033
Right.

43:59.034 --> 44:00.392
He's angry at us.

44:00.393 --> 44:01.882
If he finds out about
your guesthouse business,

44:01.883 --> 44:02.593
he'd be furious.

44:02.594 --> 44:04.202
He might throw the gifts out.

44:04.203 --> 44:06.373
He's already mad at us for doing business.

44:08.953 --> 44:09.802
Why is that?

44:09.803 --> 44:11.213
What did you tell him?

44:11.803 --> 44:13.202
It's about renting their ancient residence

44:13.203 --> 44:14.512
for the bookstore.

44:14.513 --> 44:15.943
We'll talk about that later.

44:16.203 --> 44:16.913
Just skip him.

44:16.914 --> 44:17.722
There's another one left, right?

44:17.723 --> 44:18.433
Go to the next place first.

44:18.433 --> 44:19.433
That's right.

44:20.203 --> 44:21.203
Hongdou.

44:21.553 --> 44:23.583
Take the gifts and come with me.

44:24.073 --> 44:25.073
Granny.

44:26.393 --> 44:26.683
Granny.

44:26.684 --> 44:28.063
Don't go.

44:29.323 --> 44:30.693
Is Grandpa Yang home?

44:35.913 --> 44:38.543
Shouldn't you get in and
protect your girlfriend?

44:40.953 --> 44:42.183
Granny can handle it.

44:55.723 --> 44:56.682
Grandpa Yang.

44:56.683 --> 44:58.023
We're leaving.

45:01.843 --> 45:04.213
Grandpa Yang sends us some ribs!

45:06.073 --> 45:07.813
What's so hard?

45:08.073 --> 45:09.072
Come on.

45:09.073 --> 45:10.333
Last neighbor.

45:16.323 --> 45:18.983
Should we bring some gifts with us?

45:22.323 --> 45:23.463
I guess so.

45:28.913 --> 45:34.403
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

45:36.353 --> 45:41.323
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

45:43.763 --> 45:49.833
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

45:50.133 --> 45:55.533
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

45:58.473 --> 46:03.883
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

46:05.843 --> 46:10.723
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

46:13.273 --> 46:19.493
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

46:19.803 --> 46:26.013
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

46:28.083 --> 46:34.522
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

46:34.523 --> 46:41.293
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

46:42.653 --> 46:44.702
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

46:44.703 --> 46:49.113
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

46:49.333 --> 46:56.583
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

